      "summary": "Re-review scaffold ownership qualification after fixing reviewer-found duplicate/normalized-alias target staging leak with preflight rejection and a regression test. All 293 tests and repository gates pass. Inventory adds four scaffold modules; capability fixture is unchanged. Review all scope and corrective fix without edits or commits.",
